IoT Smart Washroom Hygiene System 
Hardware Setup & Pin-to-Pin Connection Documentation 
1. System Overview 
This document describes the complete hardware setup of the IoT-based Smart Washroom 
Hygiene System using XIAO ESP32-C6, MQ-136, MQ-137, and CCS811 sensors. It includes 
pin-to-pin wiring details, operating voltages, power requirements, and electrical 
considerations. 
2. Components Used 
1. XIAO ESP32-C6 Microcontroller 
2. MQ-136 Gas Sensor (H2S detection) 
3. MQ-137 Gas Sensor (NH3 detection) 
4. CCS811 Air Quality Sensor (VOC & eCO2) 
5. TP4056 Li-ion Charging Module 
6. Li-ion Battery (Recommended: 2000–2500 mAh for 1-week backup) 
