6. Important Electrical Considerations 
• All GND connections must be common. 
• MQ sensor analog outputs may reach 5V; ensure ADC protection if required. 
• Recommended battery capacity for 1-week operation (2-hour interval reading): 2000
2500 mAh. 
• Use deep sleep mode between readings for power optimization. 
